    {
      "id": "19:01a44fcb36664ffcad48a30c6f952864@thread.v2",
      "topic": "L3 Plant Standards",
      "plant": "L3",
      "web_url": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/chat/19%3A01a44fcb36664ffcad48a30c6f952864%40thread.v2/0?tenantId=46913ced-e190-4f33-b3f3-2a38ddf9cac4",
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "1787509076579",
          "from": "Preston Tregaskis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-23T18:17:56.579Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T12:17:56-06:00",
          "text": "Sorry guys, just finished up with yardwork. \n \nSo we've got roto rooter coming out Monday and we'll need to clean according to that SSOP before starting the line correct?",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1787509481066",
          "from": "Jorel Gourdin",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-23T18:24:41.066Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T12:24:41-06:00",
          "text": "Yep!",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1787509557555",
          "from": "Preston Tregaskis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-23T18:25:57.555Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T12:25:57-06:00",
          "text": "Got it. Thanks for the response team. Good way for me to learn that process! I'll have the QA team ready to support and inspect the area tomorrow morning once the cleaning has been finished.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1787519709999",
          "from": "Chad Stone",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-23T21:15:09.999Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T15:15:09-06:00",
          "text": "Preston Tregaskis Jorel Gourdin\n\nThe drain is not overflowing and I do not have confirmation that roto rooter will be out tomorrow. Working on this now. \n\nSince we are not putting water down this drain I will have the teams sanitize around the drain and then start up. \n\nWhen we do get roto rooter out we will pause the line until the work is done and the cleaning is complete. \n\nIf you have concerns with this plan please give me a call.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1787522506936",
          "from": "Preston Tregaskis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-23T22:01:46.936Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T16:01:46-06:00",
          "text": "Sounds good to me.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1787525572379",
          "from": "Chad Stone",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-23T22:52:52.379Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T16:52:52-06:00",
          "text": "Rich Brierley,\n\nCan you make sure the team clean the top and around the drain by ML1 before starting tomorrow morning?\n\nI will let you know when I get confirmation about roto rooter.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1787538734088",
          "from": "William  Lopez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-24T02:32:14.088Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T20:32:14-06:00",
          "text": "Roto-Rooter will be there by 8am to work on floor drain",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1787539495035",
          "from": "Chad Stone",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-24T02:44:55.035Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-23T20:44:55-06:00",
          "text": "Rich Brierley,\n\nAs we discussed have Grey Boscan and the leaders follow the chemical concentration of cleaning the top of the drain covers and the floor around it. \n\nThen they should focus on the line and getting it ready to run. \n\nWe will run until roto rooter arrives and sets up. \n\nStop depositing and have the teams away from the drains while roto rooter works on them. (They can be at the end of line and run out the chocolate). \n\n** if any of this doesn’t look good based on them cleaning then stop with the chocolate in the cooling tunnel \n\nOnce roto rooter is finished then we will have to follow the full drain cleaning process before starting up again",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        }
      ]
    },
